        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "a) Statement of Intent—The purpose of the sick leave bank is to provide sick leave to contributors to the bank after their accumulated sick leave has been exhausted—and more specifically to provide such leave from the bank in cases of catastrophic illnesses.",
            "block_bbox": [
                89,
                112,
                679,
                211
            ],
            "block_id": 1,
            "block_order": 2,
            "group_id": 1,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    89.0,
                    112.0
                ],
                [
                    679.0,
                    112.0
                ],
                [
                    679.0,
                    211.0
                ],
                [
                    89.0,
                    211.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "b) Rules",
            "block_bbox": [
                88,
                222,
                172,
                246
            ],
            "block_id": 2,
            "block_order": 3,
            "group_id": 2,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    88.0,
                    222.0
                ],
                [
                    170.99996948242188,
                    222.0
                ],
                [
                    170.99996948242188,
                    245.0
                ],
                [
                    87.99999237060547,
                    245.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(1) The leave bank may be used only by the individual contributor for his or her personal illness.",
            "block_bbox": [
                124,
                253,
                678,
                302
            ],
            "block_id": 3,
            "block_order": 4,
            "group_id": 3,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    124.0,
                    253.0
                ],
                [
                    678.0,
                    253.0
                ],
                [
                    678.0,
                    302.0
                ],
                [
                    124.0,
                    302.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(2) The leave bank may not be used for illnesses of other members of the contributor's family.",
            "block_bbox": [
                124,
                313,
                678,
                362
            ],
            "block_id": 4,
            "block_order": 5,
            "group_id": 4,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    124.0,
                    313.0
                ],
                [
                    678.0,
                    313.0
                ],
                [
                    678.0,
                    362.0
                ],
                [
                    124.0,
                    362.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(3) The leave bank may not be used by the contributor to remain away from his/her position in order to assist a member of his/her family who is ill.",
            "block_bbox": [
                125,
                373,
                679,
                446
            ],
            "block_id": 5,
            "block_order": 6,
            "group_id": 5,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    125.0,
                    373.0
                ],
                [
                    679.0,
                    373.0
                ],
                [
                    679.0,
                    446.0
                ],
                [
                    125.0,
                    446.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(4) Only earned sick leave may be contributed to the leave bank—annual and personal leave may not be contributed.",
            "block_bbox": [
                124,
                458,
                678,
                509
            ],
            "block_id": 6,
            "block_order": 7,
            "group_id": 6,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    124.0,
                    458.0
                ],
                [
                    678.0,
                    458.0
                ],
                [
                    678.0,
                    509.0
                ],
                [
                    124.0,
                    509.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(5) The sick leave bank may not be used by unit members disabled by an injury covered by Worker's Compensation.",
            "block_bbox": [
                125,
                520,
                679,
                570
            ],
            "block_id": 7,
            "block_order": 8,
            "group_id": 7,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    125.0,
                    520.0
                ],
                [
                    679.0,
                    520.0
                ],
                [
                    679.0,
                    570.0
                ],
                [
                    125.0,
                    570.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(6) Persons who enroll during the first open enrollment period up to and including December 1, 1972, shall be enrolled without regard to preexisting conditions of health if they are on active duty at the time of contribution. Thereafter, contributions can be made between July 1 and December 1 of the following year. Unit members, except for those unit members returning from extended leave and new unit members, may make contributions either thirty (30) calendar days after reassignment or upon reaching permanent status. Unit members returning from extended sick leave or disability leave will be permitted to contribute to the bank on approval of the committee.",
            "block_bbox": [
                126,
                581,
                681,
                849
            ],
            "block_id": 8,
            "block_order": 9,
            "group_id": 8,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    126.0,
                    581.0
                ],
                [
                    681.0,
                    581.0
                ],
                [
                    681.0,
                    849.0
                ],
                [
                    126.0,
                    849.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(7) Permanent and conditional unit members of the Montgomery County Public Schools shall be eligible to participate in the bank.",
            "block_bbox": [
                126,
                861,
                681,
                910
            ],
            "block_id": 9,
            "block_order": 10,
            "group_id": 9,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    126.0,
                    861.0
                ],
                [
                    681.0,
                    861.0
                ],
                [
                    681.0,
                    910.0
                ],
                [
                    126.0,
                    910.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(8) In order to draw days from the sick leave bank, unit members must contribute to the bank at the rate of one (1) day of their working hours per year for ten-month personnel, and one (1) day of their working hours per year for twelve-month personnel. Contributors must use all accumulated sick leave before applying for leave from the bank.",
            "block_bbox": [
                127,
                921,
                682,
                1068
            ],
            "block_id": 10,
            "block_order": 11,
            "group_id": 10,
